# Build artifacts
/build/
**/build/
/dist/
**/dist/

# ESP-IDF local config/lock files
**/sdkconfig
**/sdkconfig.old
**/dependencies.lock
# Fetched by the IDF component manager from idf_component.yml, so it is a
# build output rather than source -- examples/camera_stream pulls ~70k lines
# of esp32-camera into here.
**/managed_components/

# Editor-local settings (machine-specific paths; the shared entry point is
# wsm_driver.code-workspace which is committed)
.vscode/

# Local logs
**/build_check.log
**/build_result.log
**/build_exit.txt
*.log
